            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "We used the MCD12Q1 and MCD12Q2 products from the MODIS land data suite to retrieve land cover and phenology data for all available years (from 2001 to 2023, at the time of data preprocessing) at a 500-meter resolution.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "MCD12Q2",
