            "target_entity_instance": "greenup",
            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "Over the nodes selected this way, the MCD12Q2 product provides four fields that describe phenology phases: greenup, mid-greenup, mid-greendown, and dormancy.",
